<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>SCORCH — Core v28 • Living Landscape</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--panel:#17253d;--line:#3a4e70;--pink:#e64091;--ink:#e9f2ff}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#09111e;color:var(--ink);font:14px system-ui,Arial}.wrap{max-width:1720px;margin:auto;padding:14px}header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:10px 2px}h1{margin:0;font-size:21px;letter-spacing:2px}small,.muted{color:#a8bad2}.screen{max-width:100%;margin:0 auto;overflow:hidden;border:3px solid #50647f;border-radius:13px;background:#090f1d;box-shadow:0 16px 50px #0008}canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:2/1;touch-action:none}.controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1.4fr auto;gap:12px;align-items:end;padding:13px;background:#111c30;border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:0;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px}.controls label,.setup label{display:grid;gap:7px;font-size:12px;font-weight:650;color:#c5d5ea}.controls strong{font-size:16px;color:white}input,select,button{font:inherit}input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:#ef509d}input[type=text],input[type=number],select{min-width:0;width:100%;border:1px solid #516b8b;background:#21334f;padding:9px;color:white;border-radius:7px}button{border:1px solid #526c8b;border-radius:8px;background:#273c59;color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:750}button.primary{background:var(--pink);border-color:#ff78bd}button:disabled,input:disabled,select:disabled{opacity:.43;cursor:not-allowed}.status{margin-top:12px;background:#122039;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px;border-radius:10px}.summary{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:9px}.chip{border:1px solid #425575;background:#0e192b;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 9px;font-size:12px}.players{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));gap:8px}.player{padding:10px;background:#192842;border:1px solid #435a7e;border-radius:8px}.player.active{outline:2px solid #ffc75a}.player strong{font-size:14px}.bar{height:7px;margin:7px 0 4px;border-radius:8px;background:#071322;border:1px solid #425d79;overflow:hidden}.bar>div{height:100%}.player small{font-size:11px}.misc{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}.alert{color:#ffe0a0}details{margin-top:12px;border:1px solid #344966;background:#14233a;border-radius:9px;padding:10px}summary{cursor:pointer}.modal{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:50;background:#030914ed;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:10px}.modal[hidden]{display:none}.dialog{width:min(860px,100%);max-height:95vh;overflow:auto;padding:23px;background:#14233b;border:1px solid #637b9e;box-shadow:0 25px 90px #000;border-radius:15px}.dialog h2{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:24px}.cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:12px;margin:14px 0}.setupPlayers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(175px,1fr));gap:9px}.setupPlayer{padding:10px;border:1px solid #3d5473;border-radius:9px;background:#0f1a2d}.setupPlayer label{margin-top:8px}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:12px 0}.shopList{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:7px}.shopRow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:7px;border:1px solid #425879;border-radius:8px;padding:8px;background:#182943}.shopRow .label{min-width:0;flex:1}.shopRow b{display:block}.shopRow small{display:block}.shopRow button{flex-shrink:0}.note{padding:9px;border-radius:8px;color:#b8d0ed;background:#0a1830;margin:10px 0}#log{max-height:180px;overflow:auto;font:12px ui-monospace,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;color:#b9d8f6}@media(max-width:690px){.controls{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.dialog{padding:12px}h1{font-size:17px}.wrap{padding:7px}}
.headerActions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.headerActions button{padding:9px 12px}.volumeControl{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;color:#bed2eb;font-size:12px}.volumeControl input{width:100px;accent-color:#f0a661}.soundNote{font-size:11px;color:#9fb7ce}@media(max-width:580px){.headerActions{width:100%;justify-content:space-between}.volumeControl input{width:78px}}

.statsDisclosure{margin:4px 0!important;padding:5px 8px!important;background:#101e32!important;}
.statsDisclosure summary{font-weight:600;color:#a9c2dc;font-size:12px;padding:3px;}
.statsDisclosure .players{padding:9px 2px 3px;}
.miniEquipment{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:7px;min-height:30px;}
.miniEquip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;border:1px solid #50647e;border-radius:7px;padding:4px 8px;background:#182b44;font-size:12px;}
.miniEquip svg{flex-shrink:0;}
.shopIcon{width:33px;height:33px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:7px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#0e1b30;border:1px solid #3c5675;}
.shopIcon svg{width:22px;height:22px;}

/* SCORCH v16: shield inventory, active highlight, touch-friendly quick switching. */
.miniEquip.equipAction{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;background:#14263b;border:1px solid #4b627e;padding:5px 9px;font-size:11px;min-height:35px;transition:border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s}
.miniEquip.equipAction:hover{border-color:var(--icon-color);box-shadow:0 0 12px color-mix(in srgb,var(--icon-color) 30%,transparent)}
.miniEquip.shieldSelected{border:2px solid var(--icon-color);background:#253047;box-shadow:0 0 8px color-mix(in srgb,var(--icon-color) 24%,transparent)}
.miniEquip.equipAction:disabled{opacity:.7;cursor:default}
#equipmentPanel summary{cursor:pointer}
/* v21 fire-mode information */
.syncChip{border:1px solid #89d2e5;color:#d5f5ff;background:#182a49;}
#syncMessage{display:none;position:absolute;top:12px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);max-width:90%;padding:7px 15px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(9,24,44,.90);border:1px solid #8acbe7;z-index:2;pointer-events:none;font-size:12px;text-align:center;color:#f2faff;white-space:normal}
.screen{position:relative}
/* v20 economy */
.marketRise{color:#ffbb8c}.marketDrop{color:#a5eda7}.marketNeutral{color:#bbd1ec}
.resultAward{gap:10px}.economySummary{font-size:12px;color:#b8cde8;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px}
#shopMarket,#shopWorth{border-color:#98784e;color:#ffe4ae}

/* v21.1: wide arena is real world space, never a stretched canvas. */
.turnBanner{--turnAccent:#ffd77c;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 16px;margin:4px 0 9px;border:2px solid var(--turnAccent);background:linear-gradient(95deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--turnAccent) 17%,#0b1728),#121d30 65%);border-radius:11px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px #050a1590;min-height:60px}
.turnBanner[hidden]{display:none!important}
.turnEmblem{color:var(--turnAccent);font-size:27px;line-height:1;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 6px var(--turnAccent));width:35px;text-align:center}
.turnLabelGroup{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;flex:0 1 auto;gap:1px}
.turnEyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.7px;font-weight:900;color:#b9d1e6}
#turnName{font-size:clamp(18px,2.2vw,28px);line-height:1.1;color:var(--turnAccent);text-shadow:0 0 15px #111f3580;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;max-width:54vw}
.turnDetail{margin-left:auto;text-align:right;font-size:13px;font-weight:750;color:#f4f7ff}
@media(max-width:600px){.turnBanner{padding:8px 10px;gap:8px;min-height:52px}.turnEmblem{width:21px;font-size:20px}.turnDetail{font-size:11px;max-width:40%;line-height:1.25}.turnEyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1px}#turnName{font-size:18px;max-width:43vw}}

/* v22: visual tank selection, consistent battlefield scale, mobile choices */
.tankDesignSelect{color:#e1f3ff;border-color:#687b9f}
.tankDesignPreview{margin:5px 0 0;display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;min-height:59px;padding:6px 8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#15233a,#101b31);border:1px solid #405c75;border-radius:8px}
.tankDesignPreview svg{width:104px;height:50px;flex-shrink:0}
.tankDesignPreview .tankDesignMeta{display:grid;gap:2px;min-width:0}
.tankDesignMeta strong{font-size:11px;color:#e7effd}.tankDesignMeta small{font-size:10px;line-height:1.35;color:#a8bdd7}
.tankStationary{color:#ffbf75!important}.tankMobile{color:#a7efc0!important}

/* Core v24: search and filtering leave the actual 49-item catalogue intact. */
.armoryTools{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(155px,1.7fr) minmax(130px,1fr) auto auto;gap:9px;align-items:end;position:sticky;top:-23px;z-index:5;padding:12px 8px;background:rgba(18,32,54,.97);border:1px solid #425b79;border-radius:10px;backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}
.armoryTools label{display:grid;gap:4px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#cfe1f7}.armoryTools input[type=search],.armoryTools select{padding:10px 11px;background:#0a1930;color:#fff;border:1px solid #7185ab;border-radius:8px;min-width:0;width:100%}.armoryTools input[type=search]:focus-visible,.armoryTools select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #76d9fc;outline-offset:2px}.armoryTools .armoryAffordable{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;padding-bottom:9px}.armoryTools .armoryAffordable input{accent-color:#68c8ff;width:17px;height:17px}.armoryTools .armoryReset{font-size:12px;padding:10px}.armoryTools #shopCount{grid-column:1/-1;font-size:11px;color:#bed5ee}.armoryFeedback{color:#aaf0bc;margin:7px 2px 10px;min-height:16px;font-weight:650;font-size:12px}.shopRow[data-affordable=false]{opacity:.64}.shopRow small .weaponHelp{color:#a8bcce;display:block;line-height:1.25;margin-top:3px}.shopRow[hidden]{display:none!important}.shopRow .shopBuyButtons{display:grid;gap:5px;text-align:center}.shopRow .shopOwned{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#a8e4c7}.shopList .armoryEmpty{grid-column:1/-1;padding:28px;border:1px dashed #6c86a4;border-radius:9px;color:#d4e9fa;text-align:center}
@media(max-width:730px){.armoryTools{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;top:-12px}.armoryTools .armoryAffordable{padding:5px}.armoryTools .armoryReset{padding:9px}.shopRow{align-items:flex-start}}

/* v24.1: Secret human quote character — independent modal, small-screen friendly. */
.unhingedGate[hidden]{display:none!important}.unhingedGate{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:15000;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(5,9,22,.90);padding:16px;backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}
.unhingedGateCard{width:min(440px,100%);color:#fff;border:2px solid #ff4bc3;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#34204b,#111a35 70%);padding:clamp(17px,3vw,28px);border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 0 70px #f12ca450;display:grid;gap:12px}
.unhingedGateCard h2{margin:0;color:#ffdbf6;font-size:23px}.unhingedGateCard p{margin:0;color:#d4cfea;line-height:1.5}.unhingedIcon{font-size:37px}.unhingedGateCard label{font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.unhingedGateCard input{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;padding:12px;font-size:17px;border:1px solid #a675bb;border-radius:9px;background:#0d152d;color:#fff}
.unhingedGateError{color:#ff9ab0;font-size:13px;min-height:16px}.unhingedGateActions{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:flex-end}.unhingedGateActions button{padding:10px 18px}
.personaPick .unhingedChosen{color:#fca2e4}.unhingedNote{font-size:11px;color:#e7b8e9;line-height:1.3;margin-top:5px}

/* v24.2: practical game polish, no changes to core arena scale or physics. */
.battleViewActions{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin:6px 2px 7px;font-size:12px}
.battleViewActions #battleZoom{font-size:12px;padding:7px 12px;min-height:36px;background:#152640}
#battleViewport{scrollbar-color:#5a89bb #102037;scrollbar-width:thin;overscroll-behavior-x:contain}
#battleViewport.zoomed{overflow-x:auto;overflow-y:hidden}
#battleViewport.zoomed canvas{width:1600px;max-width:none;min-width:1600px;height:800px;aspect-ratio:auto}
#battleViewport.zoomed #syncMessage{position:sticky;left:0;max-width:min(90vw,600px)}
.aimField{min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.aimField>label{font-weight:650;color:#c5d5ea;font-size:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:4px}
.aimField>input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:#ef509d;min-height:22px}
.aimField>select{width:100%}
.precision{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:5px}
.precision button{padding:5px 10px;min-width:52px;min-height:35px;background:#213957;border-color:#5e83a7;font-size:13px}
.precision span{font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;color:#93b4d5}
.weaponInfo{font-size:11px;line-height:1.3;color:#b6cde3;display:block;min-height:2.6em}
.controls>#fire{align-self:stretch;min-height:72px;min-width:105px}
#game:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #a6d5ff;outline-offset:-5px}
@media(max-width:800px){.battleViewActions #battleHint{font-size:11px}.precision span{display:none}}
@media(max-width:690px){.controls{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:9px;padding:10px}.controls .aimField:nth-child(3){grid-column:1}.controls>#fire{grid-column:2;min-height:72px}.precision button{min-height:40px;min-width:60px}.battleViewActions{align-items:flex-start}.battleViewActions #battleHint{max-width:65%}}
@media(max-width:690px){#battleViewport.zoomed canvas{width:960px;min-width:960px;height:480px}}
@media(max-width:380px){.precision button{min-width:53px}.battleViewActions #battleHint{font-size:10px}}

/* v27.2: device-readable dialogue independent of the 1600 px canvas raster. */
.chatterShelf{display:none;--chatterAccent:#ffca72;margin:9px 0 10px;background:linear-gradient(105deg,#1b2341,#121c30);border:2px solid var(--chatterAccent);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:0 5px 17px #05091166}
.chatterShelf[hidden]{display:none!important}
.chatterHeading{display:flex;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px 10px;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--chatterAccent);font-size:12px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.5px}
.chatterWho{color:#e7efff;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0;font-weight:750}
.chatterQuote{margin:8px 0 10px;color:#fff;line-height:1.43;font-size:clamp(17px,4.6vw,20px);font-weight:750;overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal;text-wrap:pretty}
.chatterArchive{margin:0;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent}
.chatterArchive summary{color:#b6d4f4;font-size:13px;font-weight:650;padding:5px 0;cursor:pointer;list-style-position:inside}
.chatterHistory{max-height:190px;overflow-y:auto;display:grid;gap:7px;margin:8px 0 0}
.chatterHistoryItem{font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ecf3ff;background:#0e1a30;border-left:3px solid var(--chatterAccent);padding:7px 9px;border-radius:6px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.chatterHistoryItem strong{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#b1ccef;margin-bottom:2px}
@media(max-width:850px){.chatterShelf:not([hidden]){display:block}}
@media(max-width:390px){.chatterQuote{font-size:18px}.chatterShelf{padding:11px 12px}}
</style></head><body><div class="wrap"><header><div><h1>SCORCH <small>Core v28 · Living Landscape</small></h1><small>Wide battlefield · Dynamic cave-ins · $100,000 starting cash</small></div><div class="headerActions"><button id="audioToggle" type="button" aria-pressed="false">🔈 Enable sound</button><label class="volumeControl" for="volume">Volume <input type="range" id="volume" min="0" max="100" value="65" aria-label="Sound volume"></label><button id="showRankings" type="button" title="View the tournament standings at any time">🏆 Rankings</button><button id="newMatch">New tournament / Settings</button></div></header>
<div id="turnBanner" class="turnBanner" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" hidden>
 <div class="turnEmblem" id="turnEmblem" aria-hidden="true">➤</div>
 <div class="turnLabelGroup"><span class="turnEyebrow" id="turnPhase">CURRENT TURN</span><strong id="turnName">RED</strong></div>
 <div class="turnDetail" id="turnDetail">Aim, select a weapon, and fire</div>
</div>
<div class="battleViewActions"><span id="battleHint" class="muted">Tip: your tank is marked with an arrow. Projectile trails show where shots actually flew.</span><button type="button" id="battleZoom" aria-pressed="false" title="Enlarge the battlefield without stretching graphics. Scroll horizontally to see the whole arena.">🔍 Zoom battlefield</button></div>
<div class="screen" id="battleViewport"><canvas id="game" width="1600" height="800" tabindex="0" aria-label="Scorched Earth battlefield, keyboard arrows aim and adjust power, Space fires"></canvas><div id="syncMessage" aria-live="polite"></div></div>
<div id="hazardMessage" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden style="margin:8px 0;padding:11px 14px;border:2px solid #67c9fa;border-radius:12px;color:#dff4ff;background:#17374b;font-size:17px;font-weight:800">⚠️ Water rising</div>
<section class="chatterShelf" id="chatterShelf" hidden aria-label="Readable talking tank dialogue">
 <div class="chatterHeading"><span>🗯️ BATTLE CHATTER</span><span class="chatterWho" id="chatterWho"></span></div>
 <p class="chatterQuote" id="chatterQuote" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
 <details class="chatterArchive" id="chatterArchive"><summary id="chatterArchiveSummary">Recent sayings</summary><div class="chatterHistory" id="chatterHistory"></div></details>
</section>
<div class="controls"><div class="aimField"><label for="angle">Angle <strong id="angleText">45°</strong></label><input type="range" id="angle" min="5" max="175" value="45" aria-label="Firing angle in degrees"><div class="precision"><button type="button" id="angleDown" aria-label="Decrease angle by one degree">−1°</button><span>Fine aim</span><button type="button" id="angleUp" aria-label="Increase angle by one degree">+1°</button></div></div><div class="aimField"><label for="power">Power <strong id="powerText">65%</strong></label><input type="range" id="power" min="1" max="100" value="65" aria-label="Firing power percent"><div class="precision"><button type="button" id="powerDown" aria-label="Decrease power by one percent">−1%</button><span>Fine power</span><button type="button" id="powerUp" aria-label="Increase power by one percent">+1%</button></div></div><div class="aimField"><label for="weapon">Purchased weapon</label><select id="weapon" aria-label="Choose weapon"></select><span id="weaponInfo" class="weaponInfo" aria-live="polite"></span></div><button id="fire" class="primary">🔥 FIRE!</button></div><section class="status"><div class="summary" id="statusChips"></div><div class="miniEquipment" id="miniEquipment" aria-label="Active tank equipment and spare shields"></div><details id="allPlayers" class="statsDisclosure"><summary>▸ Player health, supplies and rankings</summary><div class="players" id="players"></div></details><div class="misc"><button id="moveLeft">◀ Move (fuel)</button><button id="moveRight">Move (fuel) ▶</button><button id="recharge" title="Uses one purchased battery to restore 10 HP">🔋 Recharge (+10)</button><button id="nextRound" hidden class="primary">Next round · Armory →</button><span id="message" class="alert"></span></div></section><details id="equipmentPanel"><summary>🛡️ Tank control & equipment (manual controls)</summary>
 <div class="cols">
  <label>Guidance (uses one on your next shot)<select id="guidanceChoice"><option value="">None</option></select></label>
  <label>Target tank<select id="guidanceTarget"><option value="">Closest opponent</option></select></label>
  <label>Shield selection<select id="shieldChoice"><option value="">No shield</option></select></label>
  <label>Parachute safety threshold<input type="number" id="chuteThreshold" value="5" min="0" max="75"></label>
 </div>
 <div class="actions"><button id="engageShield">🛡️ Activate / switch shield</button><button id="stowShield">Deactivate shield</button><button id="rechargeShield">🔋 Charge shield (+25)</button><button id="toggleChute">🪂 Parachutes: Active</button><button id="toggleTrigger">Contact trigger: Off</button><button id="inventory">Inventory</button><button id="clearTrails">Clear tracer paths</button><button id="saveMatch">Save match</button><button id="loadMatch">Restore match</button><button id="retreat">Retreat</button></div>
 <p class="muted" id="equipmentInfo">Purchased equipment appears here. One guidance item is consumed per compatible shot.</p>
</details><details><summary>Game diagnostics / Mechanics and controls</summary><p>Arrow left/right adjusts barrel angle. Arrow up/down changes power. Space fires. The Move buttons consume one fuel unit per small step. The health bar is beneath each tank. 2D cavities are carved from an occupancy grid; inspect live game diagnostics here. All CPU turns run through one simulation controller. Open diagnostics to see the last eight phase changes.</p><div id="log"></div></details>
<details><summary>🗯️ Talking Tanks — optional extra one-liners</summary>
<p class="muted">Computer tanks speak their own original personality dialogue. Each character has dozens of remarks for different battle events. These editable generic lines are retained for compatibility; no data is uploaded.</p>
<div class="cols"><label>Attack taunts<textarea id="tauntAttacks" rows="5" style="width:100%;background:#21334f;color:#fff;border:1px solid #516b8b;border-radius:7px;padding:9px">Incoming!
Behold my calculations!
Your crater is ready.</textarea></label><label>Last words<textarea id="tauntDeaths" rows="5" style="width:100%;background:#21334f;color:#fff;border:1px solid #516b8b;border-radius:7px;padding:9px">Well, that escalated.
That was expensive.
I regret everything.</textarea></label></div>
<button id="saveTaunts" type="button">Save tank dialogue</button><span id="tauntSaveMessage" class="muted"></span></details></div>
<div id="unhingedGate" class="unhingedGate" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="unhingedGateTitle">
<div class="unhingedGateCard"><div class="unhingedIcon">🔐🌈</div><h2 id="unhingedGateTitle">Secret Character: UNHINGED</h2>
<p>The family quote vault is locked. Enter the secret passcode to unlock this personality for a human player.</p>
<label for="unhingedPassword">Passcode</label><input id="unhingedPassword" type="password" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Enter secret passcode" maxlength="64" />
